flowchart TB
    Tests[Phase 2 automated tests]
    Tests --> Create[Profile creation\nA, B, C have unique IDs]
    Tests --> Isolation[Storage isolation\nCookie in A absent from B]
    Tests --> Persist[Persistence\nData survives restart and reload]
    Tests --> Rename[Rename\nSame ID and storage, new name]
    Tests --> Delete[Deletion\nTarget removed, others unaffected]
    Tests --> Tabs[Tab ownership\nTabs remain within profile]
    Tests --> Crash[Crash recovery\nData remains intact]

